<title>USA: Citizens First holders approve plan.</title>
<headline>Citizens First holders approve plan.</headline>
<dateline>NORMAL, Ill. 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citizens First Financial Corp said that shareholders at a special meeting on November 12 voted to approve the Citizens First Financial Corp 1996 Stock-Based Incentive Plan.</p>
<p>It is anticipated that the common stock to fund this plan may be acquired through purchases on the open market.</p>
<p>Citizens First at September 30 had total assets of $266.4 million.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
